{"id":"98e2eaadb15620c0","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-sld-refutation-answer.md","title":"SLD 反驳及计算答案","display":"df-sld-refutation-answer — SLD 反驳及计算答案","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-sld-refutation-answer","aliases":["72-df-sld-refutation-answer"],"display":"df-sld-refutation-answer — SLD 反驳及计算答案","depends_on":["[[72-df-sld-resolution-step]]","[[72-df-logic-program-syntax]]"],"chapter":"IX","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IX §5.1 and R1 answer restriction, print661–662/PDF673–674; positive derivation presentation","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"finite recursion, composition and answer restriction checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion","review_2026_10_22_expansion":"将反驳见证的长度与正 goal 类型直接绑定到存在量词"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-sld-refutation-answer"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-sld-refutation-answer</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sld-refutation-answer — SLD 反驳及计算答案"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4f8fbd6e08fa4850\" href=\"?note=4f8fbd6e08fa4850\" title=\"72-df-sld-resolution-step\">72-df-sld-resolution-step</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"26e8ed17356e430c\" href=\"?note=26e8ed17356e430c\" title=\"72-df-logic-program-syntax\">72-df-logic-program-syntax</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"IX"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IX §5.1 and R1 answer restriction, print661–662/PDF673–674; positive derivation presentation"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"finite recursion, composition and answer restriction checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_expansion","html":"将反驳见证的长度与正 goal 类型直接绑定到存在量词"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,G\">\\(P,G\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SLD}_P,\\star,\\varepsilon\">\\(\\mathsf{SLD}_P,\\star,\\varepsilon\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4f8fbd6e08fa4850\" href=\"?note=4f8fbd6e08fa4850\" title=\"72-df-sld-resolution-step\">72-df-sld-resolution-step</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec G\">\\(\\vec G\\)</span> 是长度 n+1 的 goal 序列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec\\theta\">\\(\\vec\\theta\\)</span> 是长度 n 的有限支持代入序列。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_k\">\\(a_k\\)</span> 在下式有限递归；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ans}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ans}\\)</span> 仅在相应长度下定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PosAt}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathsf{PosAt}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"26e8ed17356e430c\" href=\"?note=26e8ed17356e430c\" title=\"72-df-logic-program-syntax\">72-df-logic-program-syntax</a> 的正关系原子集。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\na_0&amp;:=\\varepsilon,\\qquad a_{k+1}:=a_k\\star\\theta_k\\quad(k&lt;n),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ref}_P(G;\\vec G,\\vec\\theta)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\nG_0=G\\land G_n=\\langle\\rangle\\land\\forall k&lt;n\\ \\mathsf{SLD}_P(G_k,\\theta_k,G_{k+1}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ans}(G;\\vec\\theta)&amp;:=a_n\\!\\upharpoonright^{\\!*}\\operatorname{vars}(G),\\\\\n\\operatorname{SLDAns}_P(G,\\sigma)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\ \\exists\\vec G\\in(\\mathsf{PosAt}_\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega})^{n+1}\\ \\exists\\vec\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma^n\\ (\\operatorname{Ref}_P(G;\\vec G,\\vec\\theta)\\land\\sigma=\\operatorname{Ans}(G;\\vec\\theta)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\na_0&amp;:=\\varepsilon,\\qquad a_{k+1}:=a_k\\star\\theta_k\\quad(k&lt;n),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ref}_P(G;\\vec G,\\vec\\theta)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\nG_0=G\\land G_n=\\langle\\rangle\\land\\forall k&lt;n\\ \\mathsf{SLD}_P(G_k,\\theta_k,G_{k+1}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ans}(G;\\vec\\theta)&amp;:=a_n\\!\\upharpoonright^{\\!*}\\operatorname{vars}(G),\\\\\n\\operatorname{SLDAns}_P(G,\\sigma)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\ \\exists\\vec G\\in(\\mathsf{PosAt}_\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega})^{n+1}\\ \\exists\\vec\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma^n\\ (\\operatorname{Ref}_P(G;\\vec G,\\vec\\theta)\\land\\sigma=\\operatorname{Ans}(G;\\vec\\theta)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>答案按推导顺序复合，并仅保留初始 goal 变量上的绑定。n=0 给空 goal 的恒等答案。全程跟踪有限序列，未以存在“某个成功运行”的无来源谓词替代具体推导。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-sld-resolution-step","status":"resolved","id":"4f8fbd6e08fa4850","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-sld-resolution-step]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-logic-program-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"26e8ed17356e430c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-logic-program-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sld-resolution-step","status":"resolved","id":"4f8fbd6e08fa4850","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$P,G$ 与 $\\mathsf{SLD}_P,\\star,\\varepsilon$ 取 [[72-df-sld-resolution-step]]；$n\\in\\omega$。$\\vec G$ 是长度 n+1 的 goal 序列，$\\vec\\theta$ 是长度 n 的有限支持代入序列。$a_k$ 在下式有限递归；$\\operatorname{Ans}$ 仅在相应长度下定义。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-logic-program-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"26e8ed17356e430c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{PosAt}_\\Sigma$ 取 [[72-df-logic-program-syntax]] 的正关系原子集。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"P,G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{SLD}_P,\\star,\\varepsilon","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec G","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"a_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ans}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{PosAt}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\na_0&:=\\varepsilon,\\qquad a_{k+1}:=a_k\\star\\theta_k\\quad(k<n),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ref}_P(G;\\vec G,\\vec\\theta)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\nG_0=G\\land G_n=\\langle\\rangle\\land\\forall k<n\\ \\mathsf{SLD}_P(G_k,\\theta_k,G_{k+1}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ans}(G;\\vec\\theta)&:=a_n\\!\\upharpoonright^{\\!*}\\operatorname{vars}(G),\\\\\n\\operatorname{SLDAns}_P(G,\\sigma)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\ \\exists\\vec G\\in(\\mathsf{PosAt}_\\Sigma^{<\\omega})^{n+1}\\ \\exists\\vec\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma^n\\ (\\operatorname{Ref}_P(G;\\vec G,\\vec\\theta)\\land\\sigma=\\operatorname{Ans}(G;\\vec\\theta)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2177,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-188","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IX章新增13项：[[72-df-finite-ground-program-operator]] · [[72-df-logic-program-substitution]] · [[72-df-sld-refutation-answer]] · [[72-df-sld-resolution-step]] · [[72-df-sldnf-abstract-success-failure]] · [[72-df-sldnf-safe-pair]] · [[72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier]] · [[72-ex-ground-goal-may-be-unsafe]] · [[72-ex-ground-negative-loop-information]] · [[72-lem-program-substitution-composition]] · [[72-thm-finite-ground-information-fixed-point]] · [[72-thm-first-order-unification]] · [[72-thm-sld-answer-soundness]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-185","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IX章新增13项：[[72-df-finite-ground-program-operator]] · [[72-df-logic-program-substitution]] · [[72-df-sld-refutation-answer]] · [[72-df-sld-resolution-step]] · [[72-df-sldnf-abstract-success-failure]] · [[72-df-sldnf-safe-pair]] · [[72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier]] · [[72-ex-ground-goal-may-be-unsafe]] · [[72-ex-ground-negative-loop-information]] · [[72-lem-program-substitution-composition]] · [[72-thm-finite-ground-information-fixed-point]] · [[72-thm-first-order-unification]] · [[72-thm-sld-answer-soundness]]"},{"id":"f536090b60665362","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-558","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IX章新增13项：[[72-df-finite-ground-program-operator]] · [[72-df-logic-program-substitution]] · [[72-df-sld-refutation-answer]] · [[72-df-sld-resolution-step]] · [[72-df-sldnf-abstract-success-failure]] · [[72-df-sldnf-safe-pair]] · [[72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier]] · [[72-ex-ground-goal-may-be-unsafe]] · [[72-ex-ground-negative-loop-information]] · [[72-lem-program-substitution-composition]] · [[72-thm-finite-ground-information-fixed-point]] · [[72-thm-first-order-unification]] · [[72-thm-sld-answer-soundness]]"},{"id":"ecf3419ef94e40ca","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$P$ 是 [[72-df-sld-refutation-answer]] 的确定程序；$I_P$ 是 [[72-thm-definite-least-herbrand-model]] 中 $I_\\omega$ 的本地别名。$G$ 为正 goal，$\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma$；$\\gamma:\\mathrm{Var}_S\\to\\mathsf{GT}_\\Sigma$ 为任意全闭项赋值，其对有限语法树的同时扩张沿用项递归。"}],"outgoing":["4f8fbd6e08fa4850","26e8ed17356e430c"]}